DESCRIPTION:"Gabriel Rutledge is a quick thinking\, fast-talking\, hard-wor
 king badass." - Louisville Weekly\n\nA past winner of both the Seattle Inte
 rnational Comedy Competition and The Laughing Skull Comedy Festival in Atla
