 tral's Live at Gotham\, Nickelodeon's Nickmom Night Out\, Laughs on FOX\, a
 nd Inside Joke with Asif Ali streaming on Amazon Prime Video. He has also p
 erformed at the HBO Comedy Festival in Las Vegas and his Dry Bar Comedy Spe
 cial “A Third of The Room” has been viewed millions of times online.\n\
 nGabriel has recorded 5 albums including his most recent “Good Luck in Co
 urt” which debuted at #1 on the iTunes comedy charts. He is also the auth
 or of the book "Happiness Isn't Funny: True Stories of a Road Comic.”\n\n
